# Navigation Compose 进阶

Navigation Compose 从 2.7 版本引入类型安全路由（Type-safe routes），在 2.8+ 完全稳定。结合 Kotlin Serialization，路由定义从字符串模板演进为 `@Serializable` 数据类——编译期检查参数类型、IDE 自动补全、重构安全。本文深入 Navigation Compose 的类型安全机制、嵌套导航图设计、深度链接处理以及与 Compose 动画系统的集成。

## 核心概念

Navigation Compose 的架构分三层：`NavHost`（容器）、`NavGraph`（路由表）、`NavController`（状态持有者）。类型安全路由将传统的字符串路径替换为序列化对象。

```mermaid
graph TD
    A[NavHost] --> B[NavGraph]
    B --> C["composable<Route> { }"]
    B --> D["navigation<Graph> { }"]
    D --> E["composable<SubRoute> { }"]
    F[NavController] -->|navigate| B
    F -->|popBackStack| B
    G["@Serializable Route"] -->|序列化| H["URL 路径"]
    H -->|反序列化| G
```

| 组件            | 职责                 | 2.8+ 变化                                        |
| --------------- | -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ |
| `NavController` | 管理回退栈、执行导航 | `navigate(route: T)` 接受对象而非字符串          |
| `NavHost`       | 渲染当前目的地       | 支持 `enterTransition`/`exitTransition` 全局配置 |
| `NavGraph`      | 声明路由表           | `composable<T>` 泛型重载                         |
| Route           | 路由定义             | `@Serializable data class/object`                |
| `NavType`       | 参数类型映射         | 自动从 `@Serializable` 推断                      |

## 类型安全路由定义

```kotlin
// 路由定义：使用 @Serializable 注解
@Serializable
object Home  // 无参数的路由

@Serializable
data class UserDetail(val userId: String)  // 必选参数

@Serializable
data class Search(
    val query: String = "",     // 可选参数（有默认值）
    val category: String? = null  // 可空参数
)

@Serializable
data class ProductList(
    val ids: List<Int>  // 复杂类型参数
)
```

## NavHost 与路由注册

```kotlin
@Composable
fun AppNavigation() {
    val navController = rememberNavController()

    NavHost(
        navController = navController,
        startDestination = Home,
        enterTransition = { fadeIn(animationSpec = tween(300)) },
        exitTransition = { fadeOut(animationSpec = tween(300)) }
    ) {
        composable<Home> {
            HomeScreen(
                onUserClick = { userId ->
                    navController.navigate(UserDetail(userId))
                },
                onSearch = { query ->
                    navController.navigate(Search(query = query))
                }
            )
        }

        composable<UserDetail> { backStackEntry ->
            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute<UserDetail>()
            UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)
        }

        composable<Search>(
            enterTransition = { slideInHorizontally { it } },
            exitTransition = { slideOutHorizontally { it } }
        ) { backStackEntry ->
            val route = backStackEntry.toRoute<Search>()
            SearchScreen(
                initialQuery = route.query,
                category = route.category
            )
        }
    }
}
```

## 嵌套导航图

大型应用通常按功能模块拆分导航图：

```kotlin
// 顶层导航图
@Serializable object AuthGraph
@Serializable object MainGraph

NavHost(navController = navController, startDestination = AuthGraph) {
    // 认证流程子图
    navigation<AuthGraph>(startDestination = Login) {
        composable<Login> { LoginScreen(...) }
        composable<Register> { RegisterScreen(...) }
        composable<ForgotPassword> { ForgotPasswordScreen(...) }
    }

    // 主界面子图
    navigation<MainGraph>(startDestination = Home) {
        composable<Home> { HomeScreen(...) }
        composable<UserDetail> { ... }

        // 设置流程再嵌套
        navigation<SettingsGraph>(startDestination = SettingsMain) {
            composable<SettingsMain> { ... }
            composable<SettingsNotification> { ... }
        }
    }
}

// 模块化：各模块提供自己的导航图扩展函数
// feature-settings/navigation.kt
fun NavGraphBuilder.settingsGraph(navController: NavController) {
    navigation<SettingsGraph>(startDestination = SettingsMain) {
        composable<SettingsMain> { ... }
        composable<SettingsNotification> { ... }
    }
}
```

## 深度链接处理

类型安全路由自动支持深度链接映射：

```kotlin
composable<UserDetail>(
    deepLinks = listOf(
        navDeepLink<UserDetail>(
            basePath = "https://myapp.com/user"
        )
    )
) { backStackEntry ->
    val route = backStackEntry.toRoute<UserDetail>()
    UserDetailScreen(userId = route.userId)
}

// 对应的 URL：https://myapp.com/user/{userId}
// 参数自动从 URL path/query 中解析

// AndroidManifest.xml 中声明 intent-filter
// <data android:scheme="https" android:host="myapp.com" />
```

## 导航结果回传

Compose Navigation 支持通过 `SavedStateHandle` 回传结果：

```kotlin
// 在目标页面设置结果
@Composable
fun ColorPickerScreen(navController: NavController) {
    val colors = listOf(Color.Red, Color.Green, Color.Blue)
    LazyColumn {
        items(colors) { color ->
            ColorItem(color) {
                navController.previousBackStackEntry
                    ?.savedStateHandle
                    ?.set("selected_color", color.toArgb())
                navController.popBackStack()
            }
        }
    }
}

// 在调用页面接收结果
@Composable
fun SettingsScreen(navController: NavController) {
    val selectedColor = navController.currentBackStackEntry
        ?.savedStateHandle
        ?.getStateFlow<Int?>("selected_color", null)
        ?.collectAsState()

    Button(onClick = { navController.navigate(ColorPicker) }) {
        Text("选择颜色")
    }

    selectedColor?.value?.let { argb ->
        Box(Modifier.size(48.dp).background(Color(argb)))
    }
}
```

## 与 Bottom Navigation 集成

```kotlin
@Composable
fun MainScreen() {
    val navController = rememberNavController()

    Scaffold(
        bottomBar = {
            NavigationBar {
                val navBackStackEntry by navController.currentBackStackEntryAsState()
                val currentRoute = navBackStackEntry?.toRoute<Any>()

                bottomNavItems.forEach { item ->
                    NavigationBarItem(
                        selected = currentRoute == item.route,
                        onClick = {
                            navController.navigate(item.route) {
                                popUpTo(navController.graph.startDestinationId) {
                                    saveState = true
                                }
                                launchSingleTop = true
                                restoreState = true
                            }
                        },
                        icon = { Icon(item.icon, contentDescription = null) },
                        label = { Text(item.label) }
                    )
                }
            }
        }
    ) { padding ->
        NavHost(
            navController = navController,
            startDestination = Home,
            modifier = Modifier.padding(padding)
        ) { /* ... */ }
    }
}
```

## 小结

- Navigation Compose 2.8+ 用 `@Serializable` 对象替代字符串路由，获得编译期类型安全
- 嵌套导航图（`navigation<T>`）将路由按功能模块隔离，支持多模块架构
- 深度链接通过 `navDeepLink<T>(basePath)` 自动映射 URL 参数到路由字段
- 结果回传使用 `SavedStateHandle` 在 BackStackEntry 间传递数据
- Bottom Navigation 通过 `saveState`/`restoreState` 实现标签页状态保持

